OL,3,GNEWSANegotiations continue as Stormont
OL,4,Abudget offer increases to #1.5bn
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Stormont executive is now in a
OL,7,F"substantive negotiation" with the
OL,8,Fgovernment on additional money to break
OL,9,Fthe budget deadlock, Finance Minister
OL,10,FJohn O'Dowd has said.
OL,12,FHe was speaking after ministers met the
OL,13,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,14,FBryant on Friday morning as an
OL,15,Fincreased offer was made to the
OL,16,Fexecutive of #1.5bn over the next three
OL,17,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
