OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSANegotiations continue as Stormont
OL,4,Abudget offer increases to #1.5bn
OL,5,
OL,6,FO'Dowd said he did not believe that the
OL,7,Ftalks need to go on for "weeks", adding
OL,8,Fthat he and others had been pressing
OL,9,Fthe Treasury for months to come to the
OL,10,Ftable.
OL,12,FOn Monday, Sir Chris visited Stormont
OL,13,Fand made an initial offer of #350m per
OL,14,Fyear over the same period to help
OL,15,Fstabilise the executive's finances - a
OL,16,F#1.1bn package.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
